msgid "A panel with what is worn next to the item description."
msgstr "在物品说明旁显示已穿戴装备的面板。"

msgid "Show while held"
msgstr "按住时显示"

msgid "The panel is visible only while this key is held."
msgstr "仅在按住此键时显示面板。"

msgid "Compare with an empty slot"
msgstr "与空栏位比较"

msgid "Off - no panel when nothing suitable is worn."
msgstr "关闭 - 未穿戴合适装备时不显示面板。"

msgid "Total percentage"
msgstr "总百分比"

msgid "The main axis, plus a bonus for each better property, minus one for each worse property and for extra weight."
msgstr "主轴数值，每项更好的属性加分，每项更差的属性及额外重量减分。"

msgid "Per property, %"
msgstr "每项属性，%"

msgid "Per extra kg, %"
msgstr "每额外千克，%"

msgid "Colours"
msgstr "颜色"

msgid "Better"
msgstr "更好"

msgid "auto - as in the game's item tooltip, or #RRGGBB."
msgstr "auto - 与游戏物品说明相同，或 #RRGGBB。"

msgid "Worse"
msgstr "更差"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgid "Detailed log"
msgstr "详细日志"

msgid "Details in RE_Kenshi_log.txt."
msgstr "详细信息写入 RE_Kenshi_log.txt。"

msgid "Compares the item under the cursor with what is worn: a panel next to the item description."
msgstr "将光标下的物品与已穿戴的装备进行比较：在物品说明旁显示面板。"

msgid "The panel is shown only while this key is held. always - the panel is always shown."
msgstr "仅在按住此键时显示面板。始终 - 面板一直显示。"

msgid "On - compare with an empty slot too, Worn: nothing. Off - no panel when nothing suitable is worn."
msgstr "开启 - 也与空栏位比较，已穿戴：无。关闭 - 未穿戴合适装备时不显示面板。"

msgid "A total at the bottom of the panel: the main axis, plus a bonus for each better property, minus one for each worse property and for extra weight."
msgstr "在面板底部显示总计：主轴数值，每项更好的属性加分，每项更差的属性及额外重量减分。"

msgid "How many percent each property that got better adds to the total, and each one that got worse takes away."
msgstr "每项变好的属性为总计增加的百分比，以及每项变差的属性扣除的百分比。"

msgid "How many percent each extra kilogram takes away from the total."
msgstr "每多出一千克从总计中扣除的百分比。"

msgid "Colour of what gets better. auto - like the +2 in the game's item tooltip, or #RRGGBB."
msgstr "变好的数值的颜色。auto - 与游戏物品说明中的 +2 相同，或 #RRGGBB。"

msgid "Colour of what gets worse. auto - like the -1 in the game's item tooltip, or #RRGGBB."
msgstr "变差的数值的颜色。auto - 与游戏物品说明中的 -1 相同，或 #RRGGBB。"

msgid "Details in RE_Kenshi_log.txt: the item under the cursor, for whom, what it is compared with and its raw numbers. Written only when the item changes."
msgstr "在 RE_Kenshi_log.txt 中记录：光标下的物品、为谁比较、与什么比较以及物品的原始数值。仅在物品变化时写入。"

